// ===========================================================================
// MikuDanceStudio resources - thin index
// ===========================================================================
// All original resources are re-embedded byte-exact from the original
// MikuMikuDance.exe .rsrc tree by res/gen_resources.rc (generated by
// scripts/dump_rsrc.py):
//   SAMPLE02 / SAMPLE02E menus (8 popups, 103 commands each)
//   48 RT_DIALOG templates (600..817)
//   bitmaps 101/119, PNG 102..114, XFILE 115, RCDATA 117/118
//   icon group 100 (+ RT_ICON 1..6)
//   Common-Controls v6 manifest (OpenMP sxs dependency stripped - see
//   scripts/dump_rsrc.py; modern machines lack the VC90 assembly and the
//   exe would fail to start with the dependency present).
// =========================================================================//
